notes: |
  Snapshot taken AFTER experiments/replay_completion.py merged this experiment's
  lintas_buku_edges.json into Yhoga Aura. Source state for the replay was
  extraction-v2-reviewed.

  Verified state at capture: 3 Grade / 17 Chapter / 81 Subtopic / 342 Concept /
  418 ConceptTarget; total relationships = 1064 + (count of LINTAS_BUKU_* edges
  added by this run, fill after run).

  Use this .backup as the rollback point for this completion experiment.
  Restoring it returns the live DB to byte-identical state with this folder's
  lintas_buku_edges.json applied on top of extraction-v2-reviewed.
